  "issue_number": 556,
  "issue_title": "Turn browse/detail pages into stronger decision and conversion surfaces",
  "issue_body": "Parent epic: #550\nRefs: #432, #440, #549\n\n## Goal\nMake browse and detail pages help users decide, compare, and take the next action instead of stopping at static entry pages.\n\n## Requirements\n- Improve compare tray UX beyond the foundation table from PR #549.\n- Add clearer entry-to-entry comparison around source, install, safety, privacy, package trust, and review status.\n- Improve CTAs for copy/install/API/LLM/Raycast/MCP/newsletter/claim where appropriate.\n- Keep sensitive payloads out of intent events.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- Users can compare saved entries and understand trust differences without opening every page.\n- CTA events degrade safely when D1/analytics is unavailable.\n- Visible changes have desktop and mobile review evidence.\n\n## Validation expected\n- `pnpm test`\n- `pnpm build`\n- Desktop and mobile screenshots\n",
